# 💎 DIAMOND Bot — Documentation

This is the official guide for the DIAMOND Discord bot, designed for family management and community automation on GTA5RP.

---

## 🛠️ Initial Setup (Discord Administrator Only)

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `!роль_админ @role` | **First step.** Sets the role that will manage the bot. |

*Once this is set, all following configuration commands are available to the bot's administrator role.*

---

