## 🎯 Event Collections (Administrator Only)

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `/vzp [count] [name] [time]` | Create VZP collection. Tags **VZP + MP roles** |
| `/mp [count] [name] [time]` | Create MP collection. Tags **MP role** |
| `/reaki [count] [name] [time]` | Create Event collection. Tags **Reactions role** |
| `!vzp [count] [time] [name]` | Prefix version: e.g., `!vzp 10 20:30 VZP` |
| `!mp [count] [time] [name]` | Prefix version: e.g., `!mp 10 20:30 MP` |
| `!list [count] [time] [name]` | Prefix version: e.g., `!list 35 20:30 Event` |

**Features:**
- 🖼️ **Images:** Attach a photo to the command to show it in the embed.
- 🕐 **Timing:** The `time` parameter (e.g. `20:30`) is displayed as `🕐 Time: 20:30`.
- 🪑 **Reserve List:** Now automatically included in the embed.
- 🔢 **Slots:** $\le 24$ slots $\rightarrow$ numbered buttons; $25+$ slots $\rightarrow$ one ✅ button.
- 💬 **Threads:** A live participant list is automatically created in a thread.

### Management
| Command / Button | Location | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `!замена <old_id> <new_id>` | In Event Thread | Replace member in slot (0 = remove) |
| 🔒 Close List | Event Embed | Block new registrations |
| 🔓 Open List | Event Embed | Allow registrations again |

