## 🛒 Store Management (Administrator Only)

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `/магазин` | Deploy store panel |
| `/добавить_товар` | Add item (opens form) |
| `/убрать_товар <id>` | Remove item by ID |
| `/список_товаров` | List all items with ID |
| `/товар_роль <id> @role` | Bind a role to a `give_role` item |
| `/лог_магазина #channel` | Channel for purchase logs |
| `/роль_магазина @role` | Role tagged for `notify` (manual delivery) items |

**Item Action Types:**
- `remove_warn`: Automatically removes one warn.
- `give_role`: Automatically grants a bound role.
- `notify`: Deducts points + logs for manual delivery.

