## 📂 Advanced Features

### 👥 Private Rooms
| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `/приват channel_trigger category panel_channel` | Set up private room system |

### 💬 Feedback
- `!feedback`: Create a feedback panel.
- Users can submit suggestions via form.
- Admins receive the suggestion in a log channel with an automatic discussion thread.

### 📜 Contracts
- `!контракт`: Create a contract panel.
- Users can la "take" contracts by specifying duration and start time.

### 👤 Personal Cabinet
- Users can check their balance, warns, statistics, and send feedback privately.

### 🔊 Voice Rewards
- Points are automatically granted for time spent in designated voice categories.
- Rewards depend on activity (no mute, 2+ people).

### 📊 GTA5RP Stats
- `/статистика`: Live online count for all GTA5RP servers (refreshes every 30s).

